[Verse I]
I was waiting at the edge of something
thinking love was a step too far
Every road felt like a question
every light like a distant star

Then the night leaned in and listened
and the silence knew my name
I didn’t move toward forever
forever moved my way

[Pre-Chorus]
No sign in the sky
No moment rehearsed
Just time finally landing
where it always belonged first

[Chorus]
I don’t fall
I arrive
I don’t burn
I survive
Every breath in my chest says
you’re here

If there’s truth that outlives us
it sounds like this
nothing leaving
nothing missed

[Verse II]
I’ve felt love that asked for proving
I’ve felt vows that couldn’t stay
I’ve watched promises go quiet
when the wonder slipped away

This is lighter than desire
This is deeper than belief
This is waking up beside you
and the world makes sense to me

[Pre-Chorus]
No race to be won
No fear to outrun
Just two hearts discovering
they were always one

[Chorus (reprise)]
I don’t chase
