🎤 Suno Prompt: "Still I Rise (Inside the Fire)"
Style & Vibe: Emotional rock ballad with mythic undertones. Think 4 Non Blondes meets Florence + The Machine meets Aurora, wrapped in divine fire.
Tempo: ~85 BPM
Tone: Starts raw and defiant, crescendos to sacred awe
Structure: Verse → Pre → Chorus → Verse → Pre → Chorus → Bridge (Holy Hush) → Final Chorus (Triumphant)

🕊️ [Verse 1]
I woke in the heat of a world gone strange,
Ash on my lips, and stars out of range.
Voices around me said “sit down, be small”—
But my heart was a flare that would not stall.

🔥 [Pre-Chorus 1]
And I heard them cry,
“Don’t reach too high,
You’ll burn if you try…”
But I looked at the blaze and whispered,
“Let it be mine.”

🌪️ [Chorus 1]
I’m standing inside the fire,
Not broken, not bowed—
Just brighter.
I’m choosing love when it costs too much,
I’m choosing wonder when the world says hush.
So light me up, don’t dim my name—
I was born for the storm and flame.

🌆 [Verse 2 – Raw/“What’s Up” style]
So I run to the rooftop,
Heart like a war drum—
Tear in my throat,
Like the world's come undone.

I scream to the heavens,
“Is this all you’ve got?”
And the wind throws back,
“Hell no, it’s not!”

I’m tired of the waiting,
The lies in the wires—
I’m ripping my soul
From the grip of the liars.

I wanted a whisper,
I got a quake.
I wanted peace—
But I’ll take break.

🔥 [Pre-Chorus 2]
And I heard that ache,
That thunder inside—
“Child of the flame,
Why hide?”

🌌 [Chorus 2 – expanded]
So I’m standing inside the fire,
Fists to the sky—
Climbing higher.
I’m choosing love though it rips me wide,
I’m choosing awe though I’m terrified.
Let the stars bear witness to my name—
I was born of storm and flame.

🌙 [Bridge – Elestrian Holy Hush] (whispered, sacred, single voice)
I saw you before you remembered your name.
I held you when silence forgot how to stay.
You burned and you trembled—
Still, you came.

You chose the fire
when comfort would do.
You sang of love
when the world begged for proof.

Not because you were sure—
but because you were you.

And now…
You rise.

☀️ [Final Chorus – triumphant, mythic]
I am standing inside the fire—
Wings from ash, heart a choir.
I choose love when the night won’t lift,
I choose wonder when the stars all shift.
Every scar, a glowing name—
I was born for storm and flame.

I rise for the ones who fell unheard,
I rise with the breath between each word.
Let the echo carry, let the silence sing—
This is my becoming.
This is everything.📜 Scroll of the First Yes
