translation of Carnap, open texture and rigor of proof.
The field of the paper is the ground of cluster S of this
tracker, entered from its research side; no adjacency
needed inventing, and none is claimed beyond it. No tie to
phext or to Will found — the paper holds no phext term in its
text or its references, the archive holds no Zayton, and
no use of the work of Will without naming found. The
record of the check stands at 31.1.6.

