its kin in method: the wiped twin is a judge built
from the same system), and from cluster B (the
harness layer, which this study measures as a
learner and finds at zero). Links outward: 1.2.193
to cluster M (1.2.97, measure-then-change, kept as a
program); 1.2.186 to cluster O (1.2.116, the price
of a judge); 1.2.190 and 1.2.191 to cluster L
(1.2.87, records that govern by approval — one
state, settled steps); 1.2.192 to the standing
record (1.4.x), whose steps are taken by receipt —
the audit of stores drawn from this study applies to it, and the
synthesis at 25.2.1 says how. No restructure pass
fell due: the count stands at 197, and the next
pass falls at Paper 020 or 200 concepts. Standoff
map for cluster U (1.2.186-1.2.197): foundations
1.3.85; words 1.3.209-1.3.210.
Addendum — Study S009 (2026-11-13): cluster V
founded — proof as craft: the crafting game
(1.2.198); the position is a partial proof
(1.2.199); recipes with the names of Lean (1.2.200); the live proof (1.2.201); the room an
assumption opens (1.2.202); a lemma that becomes
a recipe (1.2.203); the bench that offers only
legal moves (1.2.204); the fantasy skin (1.2.205).
The centre of gravity of the study stands apart from
its neighbours: from cluster Q (theorem proving
by machine — the same Lean, the opposite seat,
the machine spending the names the game teaches);
from cluster S (logic read as structure — here
logic stands as activity, not as reading); and
from cluster M (learning by building — the
nearest kin: crafting is building whose every
step is a checked deduction). Links outward:
1.2.199 to the foundation 1.3.162 (a proof state
and a tactic); 1.2.203 to cluster Q (1.2.150, the
lemma pipeline); 1.2.201 to Chapter 23 (the
findings on display at 23.2.1); 1.2.204 to the
standing record (1.4.x), whose discipline is its
opposite. Restructure Pass #10 fell due inside
this taking-in and stands logged above; the next
falls at Paper 020 or 220 concepts, the count
standing at 205. Standoff map for cluster V
(1.2.198-1.2.205): foundations 1.3.211, 1.3.162,
1.3.78, 1.3.73, 1.3.85.

